## The Shore Remembers

::bg{location="harbor" time="morning"}
::music{playback="change" mood="triumphant" volume="normal" assetId="music.hopeful"}
::actor{character="mara" anchor="left" action="fadeIn" emotion="hopeful" costume="coat"}
::actor{character="elio" anchor="right" action="fadeIn" emotion="happy" costume="plain"}
@narrator{code="0010"}: Morning finds the harbor rinsed clean by the tide.
@mara{code="0010" emotion="surprised"}: The lighthouse is dark.
@elio{code="0010" emotion="happy"}: Then it has finally slept.
@mara{code="0020" emotion="sad"}: I thought grief would feel like losing her again.
@elio{code="0020" emotion="hopeful"}: It can feel like making room.
@narrator{code="0020"}: A blue ribbon rests on the pier, dry despite the waves.
@mara{code="0030" emotion="hopeful"}: She chose the shore.
@elio{code="0030" emotion="happy"}: And left us breakfast.
@mara{code="0040" emotion="happy"}: You call seaweed breakfast?
@elio{code="0040" emotion="neutral"}: I call it a challenge.
@narrator{code="0030"}: They laugh until the gulls complain.
@mara{code="0050" emotion="hopeful"}: We will repair the lantern.
@elio{code="0050" emotion="happy"}: Together?
@mara{code="0060" emotion="hopeful"}: Together.
::cg{assetId="cg.reunion" display="show" layout="inset"}
@narrator{code="0040"}: The signal is gone, but the promise remains.
::cg{assetId="cg.reunion" display="hide"}
::music{playback="stop"}
::actor{character="mara" action="fadeOut"}
::actor{character="elio" action="fadeOut"}
@narrator{code="0050"}: Dawn ending.
::set{run.finished = true}
